WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.636 --> 00:00:05.905 line:0%
Hi, my name is Rafi Taherian.

00:00:05.905 --> 00:00:08.975 line:0%
I'm the Associate Vice President
of Yale Hospitality.

00:00:08.975 --> 00:00:12.045 line:0%
Let's talk about this great
alternative to your diet.

00:00:14.848 --> 00:00:17.751
A plant forward diet
is a style of eating

00:00:17.751 --> 00:00:22.655
that emphasizes and celebrates
minimally processed,
plant based food.

00:00:22.655 --> 00:00:24.457
This diet consists of

00:00:31.564 --> 00:00:34.200
The idea comes from
Mediterranean diets

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:37.203
where animal protein is
not at the center of the dish

00:00:37.203 --> 00:00:40.306
but is instead used
as a flavor enhancer.

00:00:40.306 --> 00:00:44.511
Unlike a vegeterian or
vegan diet, it doesn't
restrict your eating.

00:00:44.511 --> 00:00:48.748 align:end position:100%
A vegeterian diet
completely elminates
meat, poultry, and fish

00:00:48.748 --> 00:00:53.586 align:start position:0%
and a vegan diet
excludes all animal
products or byproducts.

00:00:53.586 --> 00:00:57.190
A plant forward diet
thoughtfully refocuses the meal

00:00:57.190 --> 00:01:01.194
on vegetables and fruits
without eliminating
animal products.

00:01:01.194 --> 00:01:04.964
A plant forward diet is
better for the planet
and better for you.

00:01:04.964 --> 00:01:08.201
Animal-based food
has a bigger carbon footprint

00:01:08.201 --> 00:01:09.335
than plant-based food.

00:01:09.335 --> 00:01:11.404
Plus, eating a
plant forward diet

00:01:11.404 --> 00:01:15.875
has been shown to reduce the
risk of heart disease and
Type 2 diabetes.

00:01:17.844 --> 00:01:21.114
If you're following a vegan or
vegeterian diet, good for you

00:01:21.114 --> 00:01:25.718
just please don't rely heavily
on super processed
meat substitutes.

00:01:25.718 --> 00:01:28.788
Number two is be adventurous
when it comes to food.

00:01:28.788 --> 00:01:32.492
The majority of people on this
planet use fresh herbs, spice,

00:01:32.492 --> 00:01:35.762
fermented food, and all sorts of
other cooking techniques

00:01:35.762 --> 00:01:38.565
to create delicious,
healthy, and bold flavors.

00:01:38.565 --> 00:01:40.667
Try it! You might like it!

00:01:40.667 --> 00:01:43.470 line:0%
Three, if you're moving
toward a plant forward diet

00:01:43.470 --> 00:01:46.473 line:0%
start with things that you know
you like to eat.

00:01:46.473 --> 00:01:49.976 line:0%
If it is not delicious to you,
you won't be able to
stick with it.

00:01:49.976 --> 00:01:54.180
Remember, it's better for you
and better for the planet.

